* CVSD encoder D — same as A, but LM358 for both op-amp sections
* (Iabc servo + integrator follower).  LM311 + LM13700 + 74HC unchanged.
*
* Pins: AUDIO CLK BIT NBIT Y SYL VDD VCC VEE

.subckt cvsd_enc_d AUDIO CLK BIT NBIT Y SYL VDD VCC VEE

Xcmp AUDIO Y VCC VEE CMP 0 LM311
Rpull CMP VDD 4.7k

Xd0 CMP CLK BIT NBIT HC74_DFF
Xd1 BIT CLK Q1  NQ1  HC74_DFF
Xd2 Q1  CLK Q2  NQ2  HC74_DFF
Rnq1 NQ1 0 1Meg
Rnq2 NQ2 0 1Meg

Aadc [BIT Q1 Q2] [bd q1d q2d] hc_adc
Ax01 [bd q1d] x01d hc_xor
Ax12 [q1d q2d] x12d hc_xor
Aor  [x01d x12d] ncd hc_or
Adac [ncd] [NCOIN] hc_dac

R1 NCOIN SYL 51.1k
R2 SYL 0 2.55Meg
Csyl SYL 0 100n

Rvref VDD VA 100
Cvref VA 0 100u
Xoa SYL VA_EMIT VCC VEE BASE LM358
Qp IABC BASE VA_EMIT Q2N3906
Rset VA VA_EMIT 30.9k

Rd1 BIT  INP 47k
Rd2 INP  0   2.2k
Rd3 NBIT INN 47k
Rd4 INN  0   2.2k
Rlin LIN 0 100Meg
Rbin BIN 0 100Meg
Rbuf BUF 0 100Meg
Xota LIN INP INN IABC INT VCC VEE BIN BUF HALF13700

Cint INT 0 10n
Rint INT 0 100k
Xfoll INT Y VCC VEE Y LM358

.ends cvsd_enc_d
